        "python": {
          "lang": "python",
          "equivalence": "analogous",
          "code": "import asyncio\n\nasync def main():\n    rs = await asyncio.gather(*[fetch(u) for u in urls])            # 对应 Promise.all\n    settled = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)  # 对应 allSettled\n    first = await asyncio.wait(tasks, return_when=asyncio.FIRST_COMPLETED)\n\nasyncio.run(main())          # ⚠ 事件循环要自己驱动，不像 JS 由运行时托管\n\n# ⚠ 循环里不能跑同步阻塞代码：一个 time.sleep(1) 会卡住所有协程\nawait asyncio.to_thread(blocking_fn)      # 要跑阻塞代码得显式丢到线程里\n\n# gather 同样是\"快速失败但不取消\"：其余协程会继续跑完\n# Python 里没被接住的协程异常会在循环关闭时打印警告，容易误以为出了问题",
